---
source: crates/kuayle/tests/golden.rs
expression: stdout
---
Update a page's title and/or content

Usage: kuayle wiki update [OPTIONS] <--team <TEAM>|--project <PROJECT>> <PAGE>

Arguments:
  <PAGE>  

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>      [env: KUAYLE_PROFILE=]
      --team <TEAM>            Team name, key or UUID
      --project <PROJECT>      Project name or UUID
      --url <URL>              [env: KUAYLE_URL=]
      --title <TITLE>          
      --workspace <WORKSPACE>  [env: KUAYLE_WORKSPACE=]
      --content <CONTENT>      Page content (HTML or Markdown)
      --format <FORMAT>        [default: auto]
      --file <FILE>            Read the content from a file, or "-" for stdin
      --no-cache               Disable resolve disk cache [env: KUAYLE_NO_CACHE=]
      --version <VERSION>      Version the edit is based on (default: the current version)
  -h, --help                   Print help
